hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1081","Chapter on the prohibition of killing women and children, 1119 - Muhammad ibn Yahya narrated to us, he said: Abu al-Walid narrated to us, from Layth, from Nafi', that Ibn Umar (may Allah be pleased with them) informed him: A woman was found slain in one of the campaigns of the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him), and the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) condemned the killing of women and children."
